{"id":"outside-sf-ppp-loans","title":"Payroll loans to City-paid organisations outside the city","question":"How much paycheck-protection money went to the City-paid organisations based outside San Francisco, which the earlier loan screens could not see?","finding":"35 of them took 45 paycheck-protection loans worth $53.0 million (face value). 27 borrowed $150,000 or more; for 8 of those, with $23.2 million in loans, City payments in fiscal 2021 were at least 10% above fiscal 2019. Largest: Seneca Family of Agencies $10.0 million; Bay Area Community Resources $6.1 million; Reading Partners $5.0 million; Playworks Education Energized $4.9 million.","how":"Loan rows (assistance listing 59.073) among the kept USAspending rows; City payments by fiscal year from the organisation profiles where one exists (fiscal 2019 is only there), otherwise from the payment table.","limits":"The federal file gives the loan face value, not the amount forgiven; forgiveness needs the SBA loan file. The loans were sized on the whole payroll, most of it outside San Francisco for these organisations, and rising City payments in 2020-21 often reflect pandemic programmes the City added; neither is improper by itself.","tier":"REDFLAG","columns":[{"k":"org","t":"Organisation","type":"org"},{"k":"ppp","t":"Paycheck-protection loans","type":"usd"},{"k":"loans","t":"Loans","type":"int"},{"k":"city2019","t":"City FY2019","type":"usd"},{"k":"city2020","t":"City FY2020","type":"usd"},{"k":"city2021","t":"City FY2021","type":"usd"},{"k":"rose","t":"City up 10%+","type":"text"}],"rows":[{"org":"Seneca Family of Agencies","orgKey":"SENECA FAMILY AGENCIES","ppp":10000000,"loans":1,"city2019":8025970,"city2020":10369952,"city2021":8876412,"rose":"yes"},{"org":"Bay Area Community Resources","orgKey":"BAY AREA COMMUNITY RESOURCES","ppp":6121364,"loans":1,"city2019":3377688,"city2020":5524955,"city2021":4175941,"rose":"yes"},{"org":"Reading Partners","orgKey":"READING PARTNERS","ppp":5008872,"loans":2,"city2